    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into dark, ever-changing cultist dungeons in this VR roguelite\u2014and fight to uncover the secrets that bind orcs and Dragonians in uneasy peace. Mine resources, gather intel, and enact personal vendettas against enemy disciples, then return to your village to forge gear and plan your next epic descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVER-SHIFTING DUNGEONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are alike. Procedural chambers force you to choose: rescue a hostage, hunt a disciple, mine ore, or seek warlock intel\u2014each choice shifting risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR BLACKSMITHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive VR blacksmithing: smelt ore, hammer weapon blanks on the anvil and slot elemental gems. Every crafted weapon is uniquely yours, with permanent sockets, mission enchantments, and in-dungeon power surges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS &amp; TOOLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use axes, bows, or swords\u2014upgrade them with gems and swap gear between runs to adapt and discover rare variants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODLUST &amp; RISK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace near-death for power: the lower your health, the stronger you become. Let a serpent bite you to gain poison strikes, then unleash deadly attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into dark, ever-changing cultist dungeons in this VR roguelite\u2014and fight to uncover the secrets that bind orcs and Dragonians in uneasy peace. Mine resources, gather intel, and enact personal vendettas against enemy disciples, then return to your village to forge gear and plan your next epic descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVER-SHIFTING DUNGEONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are alike. Procedural chambers force you to choose: rescue a hostage, hunt a disciple, mine ore, or seek warlock intel\u2014each choice shifting risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR BLACKSMITHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive VR blacksmithing: smelt ore, hammer weapon blanks on the anvil and slot elemental gems. Every crafted weapon is uniquely yours, with permanent sockets, mission enchantments, and in-dungeon power surges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS &amp; TOOLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use axes, bows, or swords\u2014upgrade them with gems and swap gear between runs to adapt and discover rare variants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODLUST &amp; RISK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace near-death for power: the lower your health, the stronger you become. Let a serpent bite you to gain poison strikes, then unleash deadly attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
